  "title": "SEEG Resting State Recording",
  "description": "This dataset contains resting-state stereo-electroencephalography (SEEG) recordings from two patients with epilepsy, acquired with implanted depth electrodes. It is provided in BIDS format as raw intracranial EEG data.",
